  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/SOYEK7i.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"720\" height=\"186\"></span></p><p><br><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fhaven\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/WQb5y3A.png\" width=\"750\" height=\"134\"></a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\">Create: Haven Qualities 是 Create 模组（v0.5.1d）的一个附属，新增了更多方块、物品和配方，旨在提升 Create 的品质体验。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif;color:#396\">更新 1.0.1+ 现在支持包裹传动轴、齿轮、大齿轮和管道。</span></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\">查看展示与配方部分，了解此模组包含的内容。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">欢迎评论建议和讨论，但任何问题、漏洞或崩溃都</span><strong style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif;font-size:14px\">必须</strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">通过问题页面提交。</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:14px;color:#333;font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\"><em>此模组仍在开发中。</em></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/duAiK2H.png\" width=\"150\" height=\"63\"></a>&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/7SHEy62xxn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/social/discord-plural_64h.png\" width=\"63\" height=\"62\"></a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\">更新 1.0.1 展示：</span></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\"><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/snoYVez8pX8?wmode=transparent\" height=\"530\" width=\"530\"></iframe></span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\"><strong style=\"font-size:14px\">展示：</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/gMNDtDH.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"413\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/YPSvTgZ.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"413\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/P6LVUk3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"413\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/G5wWbhi.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"413\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/MUr3ydk.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"413\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/594qLXB.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"413\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Qiehl3d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"413\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/y2XXW23.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"413\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/JJ5tUzT.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"413\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1jFjLqI.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"413\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/z0rBnxC.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"413\"></span></p>\n</div><p><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\"><strong>配方：</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\"><strong>外壳：</strong>（手持物品右键同样有效）</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/j3CzALi.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"371\" height=\"156\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\">切石机：</span></strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>所有外壳均可放入切石机中获取变种。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>使用粉碎机的配方：</strong></span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\">烈焰粉 &gt; 4x 烈焰尘</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\">煤炭 &gt; 4x 煤尘 <em>（注意：这与黑色染料配方冲突，如需染料请使用磨粉机）</em></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\">钻石 &gt; 4x 钻石尘</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\">金锭 &gt; 4x 金尘</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\">铁锭 &gt; 4x 铁尘</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\">青金石 &gt; 4x 青金石尘 <em>（注意：这与蓝色染料配方冲突，如需染料请使用磨粉机）</em></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\">下界合金碎片 &gt; 4x 下界合金尘</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\">石英 &gt; 4x 石英尘</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f60\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>注意：这些粉尘是用于制作外壳的物品涂抹器，请勿与其他类型的粉尘混淆。</strong></span></em></span><br><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:14px;font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\"><strong><br>使用粉碎机回收物品的配方：</strong></span></p>\n<div>\n<div>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\">铜制潜水靴</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\">铜制潜水头盔</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\">下界合金盔甲</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\">钻石盔甲</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\">金盔甲</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\">铁盔甲</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\">皮革盔甲</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\">下界合金工具与武器</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\">钻石工具与武器</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\">金工具与武器</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\">铁工具与武器（不包括剪刀和盾牌）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\">桶</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\">属性过滤器</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\">列表过滤器</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\">书</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\">附魔书</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\">黄铜板</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\">铜板</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\">金板</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\">铁板</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\">电子管</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\">磨光玫瑰石英</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\">烈焰燃烧器</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\">酿造台</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\">铜块</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\">苦力怕头颅</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\">深板岩</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\">龙首</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\">空烈焰燃烧器</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\">附魔台</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\">镶金黑石</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\">脚手架</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\">骷髅头颅</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\">凋灵骷髅头颅</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\">僵尸头颅</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><p><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\">已知冲突：</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-recycle-everything\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create Recycle Everything</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/7SHEy62xxn\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Nt3vpL1.png\" width=\"1000\" height=\"179\"></a></span></p>",
